{"id": "EUVD-2026-55339", "enisaUuid": "e0c871f3-1820-333d-9d7b-8155b0066772", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\ndrm/amdgpu: Release VFCT ACPI table reference\n\namdgpu_acpi_vfct_bios() fetches the VFCT table with acpi_get_table()\nbut never releases it. acpi_get_table() takes a reference on the\ntable (incrementing its validation_count and mapping it on the 0->1\ntransition); without a paired acpi_put_table() the mapping is leaked\non every call, whether or not a matching VBIOS image is found.\n\nRoute all exit paths after the table is acquired through a common\nacpi_put_table(). The VBIOS image is copied out with kmemdup() before\nthe table is released, so it remains valid for the caller.\n\n(cherry picked from commit ca5988682b4cba4cd125a0fa99b2de1239164ae4)", "datePublished": "2026-08-10T12:01:03", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:43:35", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/1748043b5114ce5ee5ee874d5f821a158d70631c", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/50a75929c0c5e8ab29a3ac49dc92489873d9d261", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/312278b3091912fa56a6a587609f17dcb33465c2", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9b7de3ee5d2c5ee2a706e5f7ca0126f4fbea4da8", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/65bff26617607c1331283232016c0e89088c5b78"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-68238", "GHSA-cp54-xgp7-w9qr"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "15487cc9-6979-3b99-b933-8ee4b25f7811", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d38ceaf99ed015f2a0b9af3499791bd3a3daae21 <9b7de3ee5d2c5ee2a706e5f7ca0126f4fbea4da8"}, {"id": "34a1f18a-8d50-3f2b-aca5-1f771d0fc99e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.18.42"}, {"id": "557eeea0-736b-3f70-b46e-35c275c75f50", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.1.6"}, {"id": "811eaa31-1e68-3d8a-bce9-2f5198c76a1f", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "8ded864e-e7b3-3201-b591-d33a0b8dc05d", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d38ceaf99ed015f2a0b9af3499791bd3a3daae21 <312278b3091912fa56a6a587609f17dcb33465c2"}, {"id": "95723572-a4e2-3316-a185-820885e3d4c0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d38ceaf99ed015f2a0b9af3499791bd3a3daae21 <65bff26617607c1331283232016c0e89088c5b78"}, {"id": "b05726c6-f51d-32af-9de4-7317fb70a826", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "4.2"}, {"id": "df190a23-2d55-3cd5-a34f-0468c3f42730", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.6.160"}, {"id": "ea9de518-fbc8-3977-b241-7bd872853ae6", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 6.12.114"}, {"id": "ebcaa911-0dea-348e-a9cd-04cec54edef0", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d38ceaf99ed015f2a0b9af3499791bd3a3daae21 <50a75929c0c5e8ab29a3ac49dc92489873d9d261"}, {"id": "f2c0406d-6e17-3290-9c78-8a4619fc5331", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "d38ceaf99ed015f2a0b9af3499791bd3a3daae21 <1748043b5114ce5ee5ee874d5f821a158d70631c"}, {"id": "f3998706-7520-38e9-a25f-400052426a6e", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 7.2"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "3d7a3c30-bca7-30d5-902a-7ac2cc511d5d", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}], "isExploited": false}